    "title": "Re-thinking Psychology Research with Jerome Kagan:",
    "subtitle": "Psychology research is haunted by the “ghosts\" of unfounded assumptions and flawed methodologies. After a half century career as a pre-eminent researcher and author, Prof. Jerome Kagan challenges us to go back to the basics, to re-evaluate the methods we use to collect data and the theories that we base our conclusions on.",
